  "releaseNotes": "* Updated DotExtensions from 8.3.0 to 8.4.0\n* Add Immediate ICollection<\\T>  ``LastIndex``\n* Add Immediate  ICollection<\\T> ``RemoveRange``\n* Add Immediate Mode ICollection<\\T> ``InsertRange``\n* Add Deferred Mode IEnumerable<\\T> ``InsertRange`` and ``Insert``\n* Added Deferred Mode IEnumerable<\\T> ``SplitBy`` predicate method - This method splits the source sequence each time the predicate ``Func<T, bool>`` is true\n* Fixed issues with IEnumerable<\\T> ``SplitByProcessorCount`` extension method\n* Renamed IEnumerable<\\T> ``SplitByCount`` extension methods to ``SplitByItemCount``",
